        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2134_7995.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Gestrenge edle, ehrenveste, fromme,
<lb n="2"/>veste, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrn</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nottveste</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerneme</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersichtige</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsame</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weiße</unclear>, In-
<lb n="4"/>sonders guenstige hochgeehrte herren,
<lb n="5"/>wohlvertrauwte guote freundt,
<lb n="6"/>und getreuwe liebe <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Eidtgnoßen</orgName>,
<lb n="7"/>derselb hiemit und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iederß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seigen</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willige</unclear> dienst,
<lb n="9"/>aidgnoßische treuw und freundt-
<lb n="10"/>schafft, und was wir mehr ehren
<lb n="11"/>liebs und guots vermoegen,
<lb n="12"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungespartem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleiß</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>.
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wessen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verburgerte</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kauff</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handelßleuth</unclear>, so in
<lb n="16"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-91" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oestereichische</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landt</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handtieren</unclear>,
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwaerlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anligens</unclear> der neuwen
<lb n="18"/>ufflagen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zolls</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">staigerungen</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underschidlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zollstetten</unclear>,
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> und wider die habeningkh
<lb n="21"/>und vieler stattlich ansehenlicher
<lb n="22"/>ertheilter Intercessionen, an uns
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abermahls</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undehnig</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weh</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muethig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">supplicando</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelangen</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gstreng</unclear>.
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">edl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vst</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beyver</unclear>-
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihnen</unclear> uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derenthalb</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uebergebener</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">supplicationschrifft</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenstig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvernehmen</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2134_7996.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Obnunwohl</unclear> E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gstreng</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vst</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>.
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gl</unclear>. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißmahl</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschont</unclear> hetten, so ha-
<lb n="33"/>ben wir aber den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsren</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trungenlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebettne</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intercession</unclear> umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> vil desto
<lb n="36"/>wenig verweigern kuennen,
<lb n="37"/>als vil wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eingefüerte</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umbstendtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">motiven</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uber</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbainung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">teglich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffgesezte</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschwerden</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">attentierte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zolls</unclear>-
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">steigerung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sehr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochbeschwerlich</unclear>
<lb n="42"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wichtig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befinden</unclear>.
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Glangt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derwegen</unclear> an E. Gstreng.
<lb n="44"/>Vst. W. Gl. E. Wht. unser fründt-
<lb n="45"/>lich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüdtgnössisches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bitten</unclear> und er-
<lb n="46"/>suochen, die wöllen dise, als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obenmassen</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>ein gemeine deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vatterlandts</unclear>
<lb n="48"/>betreffende sach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihro</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bey</unclear>-
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wohnenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hohen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstande</unclear> nach
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernünfftig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwegen</unclear>, und ihro die-
<lb n="51"/>selbige zuo abschaffung und wider
<lb n="52"/>uffhebung dessen, so der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbainung</unclear>
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuwider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffgesezt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>
<lb n="54"/>ist, füer dißmahl, mit nit
<lb n="55"/>geringerem ernst angelegen sin
<lb n="56"/>lassen. Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geehrten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüdtg</unclear>.
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorfahren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gstreng</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vst</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>.
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlichmahl</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dise</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kummeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2134_7997.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="59"/>schens, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschwerden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürzekhomen</unclear>,
<lb n="60"/>sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">loblich</unclear> und hochstarks bemuoeht, und
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßwegen</unclear>
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemainer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khauffleüthen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgeordneten</unclear>
<lb n="63"/>in seinem werben mit hilff unnd
<lb n="64"/>rhat so guettig und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guothertzig</unclear>
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begegeng</unclear> als es die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">notturfft</unclear> und
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wichtigkheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear>-
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fordert</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sthl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">G</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>.
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuon</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiezue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genuegsame</unclear>
<lb n="69"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegwiß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear>. damit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear>
<lb n="70"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermog</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollhergebrachten</unclear>
<lb n="71"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jungst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernewerten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jaren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbeinung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwüschet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochlöblichen</unclear>
<lb n="72"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauß</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-91" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Osterreich</unclear></placeName> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemainer</unclear> loblich
<lb n="73"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eidtgnoschafft</orgName>, widerumb uff
<lb n="74"/>ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwiße</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzhall</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jahr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">streckhte</unclear>
<lb n="75"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zhollvergleichung</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hirinne</unclear>
<lb n="76"/>kein fernere neüwerung oder
<lb n="77"/>beschwernuß fürgenomen werden
<lb n="78"/>solle, so die in der supplication
<lb n="79"/>angedeütete gravamina, uffge-
<lb n="80"/>setzte zollbeschwerden, und neüwerung
<lb n="81"/>gentzlich abgestelt, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>.
<lb n="82"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sthl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">G</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevolch</unclear>-
<lb n="83"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burger</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinfüro</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnmolestiert</unclear> und
<lb n="84"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beruewiget</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbleiben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möchten</unclear>.
<lb n="85"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wan</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiruß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dis</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werkh</unclear>,
<lb n="86"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erhalttung</unclear> der erbeinung,
<lb n="87"/>und befüedrung der commercien
<lb n="88"/>in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemainem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vatterlandt</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2134_7998.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="89"/>(deren dann wenig ouch frische
<lb n="90"/>und keines brandts versehen, iehzo-
<lb n="91"/>mahlß.) merckhlich dienen wurde.
<lb n="92"/>Und worinnen ggl. l. Eydtg. St.
<lb n="93"/>Ad. Fb. E. Wt. wir solches hinwi-
<lb n="94"/>derumb beschulden und verdienen
<lb n="95"/>khuend, seigen wir an statt der
<lb n="96"/>unsern erbuetig, uns iedezeit
<lb n="97"/>ungefpart willig und geneigt finden
<lb n="98"/>zelassen, mit hilff deß allerhoechsten
<lb n="99"/>den wir bitten, daß er uns sampt-
<lb n="100"/>lich in bestendiger wohlfart, lange
<lb n="101"/>zeit woelle erhalten. Datum den
<lb n="102"/><origDate when="1619" resp="#ner">17 d. Junii Ao 1619</origDate>.
<lb n="103"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rhat
<lb n="104"/>der statt Sannct Gallen</orgName>.
<lb n="105"/>Den hochgeachten, edlen, gestrengen, fromen, vesten,
<lb n="106"/>ehren, und nothvesten, fuernehmen, fuersichtigen,
<lb n="107"/>ehrsamen und weisen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">der dreyzehen Orthen gemeiner
<lb n="108"/>loblicher Eydtgnoschafft</orgName>, fuertreffenliche rhatsbotten
<lb n="109"/>diser zeit uf dem tag der jahrrechnung ze <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> im
<lb n="110"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-266" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Argoeuw</placeName> beyeinandern versambt, unsern insonders guen-
<lb n="111"/>stigen hochgeehrten herren, wohlvertrauwten
<lb n="112"/>guoten freuenden und getreuwen lieben Eydtgnossen.
</p>
